Third-party software
--------------------

This plugin bundles no third-party code. Every Maven dependency is declared
with `provided` scope and is supplied by the host application at runtime:

  - Atlassian confluence 7.8.1 and activeobjects-plugin 3.2.4 (Atlassian Pty Ltd)
  - atlassian-spring-scanner-annotation 2.1.7
  - jsr311-api 1.1.1, javax.servlet-api 3.1.0, javax.inject 1

The admin screen is plain HTML with the app's own CSS, decorated by the
Atlassian User Interface (AUI) that Confluence already serves. No JavaScript or
CSS library is vendored into this repository or into the built jar.

This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by Atlassian.


Artwork
-------

src/main/resources/images/pluginIcon.png and pluginLogo.png are generated by
tools/make-icons.py from geometry in that script. No third-party artwork is
included.
